# SHA-256 of the certificate every published APK must be signed with.
#
# Not a secret — a certificate fingerprint is public by design. It lives here
# rather than in a repository secret so that changing the release key is a
# visible commit rather than a silent settings change, and so CI can catch a
# build signed with the wrong key BEFORE it reaches dist/.
#
# The private key is in the MUSICD_KEYSTORE_BASE64 repository secret. If it is
# ever lost, a new key can be generated — but everyone with the app installed
# will have to uninstall before they can install again, so keep a backup.
